ning | Digital/software in imaging & monitoring |\n| **Total** | **9/21** | **Stable-to-Widening** | **Narrow moat** |\n\n**Step 2-3 \u2014 Lynch classification**\n**Stalwart-to-Fast-Grower hybrid.** Revenue CAGR 3.9% (5-yr) [Arithmetic]; EPS CAGR ~8-10% driven by margin expansion and buybacks. Key checkpoints: (a) inventory +11% in FY25 vs revenue +4% [Arithmetic] \u2014 flag for demand-vs-stock mismatch; (b) book-to-bill 1.06 (Q2-26) [Actual] \u2014 positive forward signal; (c) PEG ~1.9 on adjusted EPS growth vs vendor PEG 1.74 \u2014 not cheap.\n\n**Step 2-4 \u2014 Financial strength scorecard**\n\n| Metric | Value | Tag |\n|---|---|---|\n| Revenue growth (5-yr CAGR / TTM) | +3.9% / +4.0% | [Arithmetic] |\n| Operating margin (TTM / 12-yr median) | 17.0% / 14.8% | [Arithmetic] |\n| ROE (GAAP) / Adjusted ROE | 14.9% / ~19-20% | [Actual vendor] / [Estimate] |\n| ROIC (GAAP) / Tangible adjusted | ~12% / ~30% | [Estimate] / [Estimate] |\n| FCF margin (FY25) / OCF/NI | 13.8% / 1.23x | [Arithmetic] |\n| Net debt/EBITDA | $1.908B / $1.96B \u2248 1.0x | [Estimate] |\n| Interest coverage (FY25) | $1.373B / ~$0.116B \u2248 11.8x | [Arithmetic] |\n| Cash | $1.677B | [Filed] |\n\n**Judgment: Excellent.**\n\n**Step 2-5 \u2014 Capital allocation scorecard (15 pts)**\n\n| Criterion | Score | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| Buyback efficiency | 2/3 | Share count \u221218.8% since 2014 (\u22121.5%/yr) [Arithmetic]; but some repurchases at >20x P/E |\n| M&A track record | 3/3 | Six cryogenic bolt-ons over 3 years; De-Sta-Co sale + minority gain \u2248 $1.3B realized [Actual, Q4-24 PR] |\n| Capex efficiency | 3/3 | Capex 2.7% of revenue [Arithmetic] yet 3.9% rev CAGR; incremental margin 38% (Q2-26) [Actual] |\n| Rationality of mix | 3/3 | \"Balance sheet remains a competitive advantage\" [Actual]; balanced toolkit |\n| Guidance accuracy | 3/3 | FY26 guidance raised at Q2 (10.45-10.65 \u2192 10.55-10.75) [Actual] |\n| **Total** | **14/15** | **Excellent** |\n\nInsider: ownership 1.26% [